      "uid": "zhcn:caf39d8cb5fd8a36a717a0fb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "甜点会带给人笑容……我认为不只是因为味道，\n而是包含了制作者的心意，\n才能换得这样的成果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f787f4ecc3f71a4d312d5f1ea903a488916c645b9e6bd2df14aa82150387897d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
