      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "替朋友做甜点的样本。\n就算还没正式开始做，\n也看得出她非常认真看待这件事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "74923b6c47c5063c1e7deaea191eb5cce02d3fe75adc9b6960c422ef3d424527",
