      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我的朋友说\n想做情人节巧克力，\n所以我想先准备几个样本。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d42fd444ea83a778a2268feb118a5bd811629302d384dffc385416257af34a46",
